    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/releases/tag/v15.1.3"&gt;v15.1.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;a title="GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x" data-hovercard-type="advisory" data-hovercard-url="/advisories/GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x/hovercard" href="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x"&gt;GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x&lt;/a&gt;: default MaxDepth of 64 for self-referential types (15.x backport) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jbogard/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jbogard"&gt;@jbogard&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4078634496" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/issues/4619" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4619/hovercard" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/pull/4619"&gt;#4619&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Security&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed an issue where certain cyclic or self-referential object graphs could trigger uncontrolled recursion during mapping, potentially resulting in stack exhaustion and denial of service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications that process untrusted or attacker-controlled object graphs through affected mapping paths may be impacted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Users should upgrade to this release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Security advisory: &lt;a title="GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x" data-hovercard-type="advisory" data-hovercard-url="/advisories/GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x/hovercard" href="https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x"&gt;GHSA-rvv3-g6hj-g44x&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/skdishansachin/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/skdishansachin"&gt;@skdishansachin&lt;/a&gt; for responsibly disclosing this issue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper/compare/v15.1.0...v15.1.3"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v15.1.0...v15.1.3&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
